      "source": [
        "# Dictionary view\n",
        "\n",
        "A dictionary view is a dynamic view of a dictionary's keys, values, or items, returned by `keys()`, `values()`, or `items()`. It reflects later changes to the dictionary.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-dictionary-view)"
      ]
    }
